\int_0^{2k_F}dq\,q^3|u(q)|^2.\\
&\text{(d) }S_0(q,\omega)\simeq
\frac{Vm^2}{2\pi^2\hbar^2}\frac{\omega}{q},
\quad 0<\omega<qv_F,\quad v_F=\frac{\hbar k_F}{m};
\text{ this gives the upper limit }q\le 2k_F.\\
&\text{(e) For }u(q)=\frac{4\pi Ze^2}{q^2+k_s^2},\\
&\hspace{2.8em}
\frac1{\tau_{\rm imp}}
=\frac{2\pi n_{\rm imp}mZ^2e^4}{\hbar^3k_F^3}
\left[
\ln\!\left(1+\frac{4k_F^2}{k_s^2}\right)
-\frac{4k_F^2}{4k_F^2+k_s^2}
\right].\\
&\hspace{2.8em}
\text{In the small-}q\text{ screened limit }k_F\ll k_s:\quad
\frac1{\tau_{\rm imp}}\simeq
\frac{16\pi n_{\rm imp}mZ^2e^4}{\hbar^3k_s^4}\,k_F
=
